# =============================================================================
# ENDO-LUMBAR repository contents
#
# Published: the statistical analysis scripts, and nothing else.
#
# Not published: result tables, figures, figure-drawing scripts and
# manuscript/document generators. The repository is the analysis code, not the
# results archive or the document build system. Running the pipeline against
# the registry data regenerates tables/ and figures/ locally.
#
# Never published: individual patient data in any form. NORspine data are
# governed by a registry data-sharing agreement. Everything under data/,
# results/ and models/ is patient-level or derived model state and is excluded
# without exception, including results/reoperation_results.rds, which holds
# per-patient identifiers and surgery dates.
# =============================================================================

# --- Patient data and fitted model objects: never published -------------------
data/
results/
models/
diagnostics/
complete_case/
supplementary_followup_eligible/
*.rds
*.npy
*.nc
*.sav

# --- Manuscript documents: shared with the journal, not the repository --------
# Anchored, so it does not also match scripts/manuscript/.
/manuscript/

# --- Result tables and figures: not published ---------------------------------
# Regenerated locally by the pipeline; the reported values live in the article
# and its supplementary material.
tables/
figures/

# --- Scripts not part of the published pipeline -------------------------------
scripts/analysis/22_pymc_bayesian.py
scripts/analysis/22a_export_data_for_pymc.R
scripts/analysis/22b_refit_bernoulli.py
scripts/analysis/22c_refit_ncp.py
scripts/analysis/22d_refit_responder.py
scripts/analysis/23_update_primary_outputs.py
scripts/analysis/refit_4k.R
scripts/review/

# --- Figure-drawing and document generation: not published --------------------
# These build the manuscript and its figures rather than producing any estimate.
scripts/analysis/18_figures_main.R
scripts/analysis/21_figures_supplement.R
scripts/manuscript/

# --- Local artifacts ----------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.RData
Rplots.pdf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
~$*.docx
